OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens into death of teen
OL,4,Ain e-scooter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has opened into the death of
OL,7,Fa 14-year-old boy who died in a crash
OL,8,Finvolving an e-scooter and a van.
OL,10,FThe hearing into the death of Aaron
OL,11,FRowe, from Lincoln, who was riding the
OL,12,Fscooter, was opened and adjourned in
OL,13,FBoston on Tuesday.
OL,15,FLincolnshire Police was called to Moor
OL,16,FLane in North Hykeham at about 17:40
OL,17,FBST on 6 September. The collision was
OL,18,Fbetween the e-scooter and a red Ford
OL,19,FTransit.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
