OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens into death of teen
OL,4,Ain e-scooter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoroner Marianne Johnson said the
OL,7,Fprecise cause of death was yet to be
OL,8,Fdetermined. She set a provisional date
OL,9,Ffor the next hearing of 8 March next
OL,10,Fyear.
